OL,3,GNEWSAMan cycling 425 miles dressed as
OL,4,Aorangutan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Derbyshire is cycling 425
OL,7,Fmiles dressed as an orangutan in aid of
OL,8,Fthe species.
OL,10,FPeter McEvoy, from South Wingfield,
OL,11,Fstarted his ride in Sheaf Square,
OL,12,FSheffield, on Monday, and aims to
OL,13,Ffinish the seven-day journey at the
OL,14,FEiffel Tower in Paris on Sunday.
OL,16,FMcEvoy is cycling an average of 60 to
OL,17,F75 miles a day (97km to 121km) to raise
OL,18,F#1,500 for the Sumatran Orangutan
OL,19,FSociety (SOS).
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
