OL,3,GNEWSAMan cycling 425 miles dressed as
OL,4,Aorangutan
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he wanted to raise awareness of
OL,7,Fthe threats facing the critically
OL,8,Fendangered Sumatran orangutans and
OL,9,Ftheir rainforest habitat.
